{"seq":3,"slug":"ranking-experiment-platform","title":"排序实验平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-search-ranking/systems/ranking-experiment-platform","wordCount":3258,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"排序实验平台\">排序实验平台</h1><p>持续优化搜索排序系统，核心是构建一套能快速、可靠地评估算法改进效果的实验基础设施。但搜索排序的实验有其特殊性——传统 A/B 测试存在<strong>干扰效应（Interference/Spillover Effect）</strong>，使得实验结果偏差，需要专门的实验方法。本文介绍搜索领域的核心实验技术：交织实验（Interleaving）、CUPED 方差缩减、以及实验平台的工程设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传统 A/B 测试</td>\n<td>随机分用户到实验/对照组</td>\n<td>实现简单，结论直观</td>\n<td>干扰效应、低功效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交织实验（Interleaving）</td>\n<td>同一请求的结果由 A/B 系统混合排列</td>\n<td>灵敏度高 10-100x，消除用户偏好噪声</td>\n<td>只测量相对偏好，不测量绝对效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CUPED</td>\n<td>利用实验前指标作为协变量减少方差</td>\n<td>等效增加样本量 20-50%</td>\n<td>需要实验前数据，不适合首次上线功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层实验</td>\n<td>多个特征同时实验，相互正交</td>\n<td>加速迭代，互不干扰</td>\n<td>需要严格管理实验依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>护栏指标</td>\n<td>预设不可下降的安全红线</td>\n<td>防止主指标好但用户体验差</td>\n<td>需要提前约定优先级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[实验方法选择] --&gt; B[传统 A/B 测试\\n适合大改动/绝对效果]&#10;    A --&gt; C[交织实验\\n适合排序算法对比]&#10;    A --&gt; D[CUPED\\n方差缩减/加速实验]&#10;    B --&gt; E[统计显著性检验\\np&lt;0.05]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F{指标方向}&#10;    F --&gt;|主指标↑ 护栏指标稳| G[上线]&#10;    F --&gt;|护栏指标↓| H[实验失败]\">graph LR\n    A[实验方法选择] --&gt; B[传统 A/B 测试\\n适合大改动/绝对效果]\n    A --&gt; C[交织实验\\n适合排序算法对比]\n    A --&gt; D[CUPED\\n方差缩减/加速实验]\n    B --&gt; E[统计显著性检验\\np&lt;0.05]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F{指标方向}\n    F --&gt;|主指标↑ 护栏指标稳| G[上线]\n    F --&gt;|护栏指标↓| H[实验失败]</pre><h2 id=\"搜索实验的特殊挑战\">搜索实验的特殊挑战</h2><h3 id=\"为什么搜索-a-b-测试有偏差\">为什么搜索 A/B 测试有偏差</h3><p>传统 A/B 测试假设实验组和对照组之间<strong>无干扰</strong>：对照组用户的行为不会影响实验组用户，反之亦然。这个假设在电商搜索中有时不成立：</p>\n<p><strong>库存效应</strong>：如果实验组的排序方案将库存有限的热门商品更多地展示给实验组用户，实验组用户购买后商品可能缺货，导致对照组用户买不到。这种情况下，实验组看起来 GMV 更高，但部分原因是&quot;抢走&quot;了本该属于对照组的流量。</p>\n<p><strong>价格效应</strong>：如果商家会根据订单量调整价格，实验组更多的购买可能导致对照组价格上涨，影响对照组的 CVR。</p>\n<p><strong>学习效应</strong>：用户在实验组看到了更好的搜索结果，可能改变了对该平台的预期和行为习惯，对照组受到间接影响（如如果是同一用户在不同时间进入不同实验组，学习效应尤为明显）。</p>\n<p>这些干扰效应使得 A/B 测试的实验组和对照组结果不完全可比，导致实验结论有偏。</p>\n<h3 id=\"搜索实验的低功效问题\">搜索实验的低功效问题</h3><p>搜索排序改进通常效果较小（0.5%-2%的 CTR 提升），而搜索指标的天然方差很大（用户之间的行为差异显著）。这导致：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要大量流量（百万级用户）才能检测到有统计显著性的效果</li>\n<li>实验周期需要1-2周才能积累足够样本，降低了迭代速度</li>\n<li>错误发现率（Type I 和 Type II Error）更高，容易做出错误决策</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"解决方案概述\">解决方案概述</h3><p>针对以上挑战，搜索领域发展了两类方法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>交织实验（Interleaving）</strong>：通过特殊的实验设计，在单次展示中对比两个算法，避免干扰效应，同时大幅提升实验功效</li>\n<li><strong>CUPED（Controlled-experiment Using Pre-Experiment Data）</strong>：通过统计技术利用实验前数据减少实验噪声，在不增加流量的前提下提升实验功效</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"交织实验-interleaving\">交织实验（Interleaving）</h2><h3 id=\"基本思想\">基本思想</h3><p>交织实验不是将用户分成两组分别看两个算法的结果，而是<strong>对同一用户</strong>展示将两个算法结果交叉混合后的结果列表，通过比较混合列表中来自两个算法的商品哪些被更多点击，来判断哪个算法更好。</p>\n<p><strong>直观理解</strong>：想象你同时面试两名翻译，让他们翻译同一段文章。与其分开评估，不如让评委直接比较两人的翻译，选择哪篇更好——这比分开评估更直接、更公平，也需要更少的评委。</p>\n<h3 id=\"team-draft-interleaving-tdi-算法\">Team Draft Interleaving（TDI）算法</h3><p>Team Draft Interleaving（Radlinski &amp; Craswell, 2010）是最常用的交织方法：</p>\n<p><strong>构建交织列表的步骤</strong>：</p>\n<p>设算法 A 的排序结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[a_1, a_2, \\ldots]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，算法 B 的排序结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[b_1, b_2, \\ldots]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从 A 的 Top-1 和 B 的 Top-1 中随机选一个放入交织列表（这一步随机确保公平性），设选中了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 属于算法 A 团队，下一步由算法 B 选：选 B 的 Top-1（不在列表中的），设为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，放入交织列表</li>\n<li>现在 A 和 B 各有1个商品，继续由 A 选下一个（A 的 Top-2，不在列表中的）</li>\n<li>交替进行，直到列表填满</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>判断胜者</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>统计用户点击中属于 A 团队的点击次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和属于 B 团队的点击次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>如果跨所有实验用户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_A &gt; c_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 A 获胜；否则 B 获胜</li>\n<li>使用符号检验（Sign Test）或 Wilcoxon 检验计算统计显著性</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"交织实验的优势\">交织实验的优势</h3><p><strong>灵敏度</strong>：交织实验比 A/B 测试灵敏度高10-20倍。同样规模的流量下，交织实验能检测到更小的效果差异，或者达到相同置信度所需的流量是 A/B 测试的1/10到1/20。</p>\n<p><strong>抗干扰</strong>：由于同一用户同时看到两个算法的结果，用户层面的行为干扰（如用户搜索习惯、当天心情）对两个算法的影响是对称的，可以天然抵消，不存在 A/B 测试中的跨组干扰问题。</p>\n<p><strong>无流量分割</strong>：交织实验可以用全量流量测试，而 A/B 测试需要分割流量（通常各50%）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"交织实验的局限\">交织实验的局限</h3><p><strong>只适用于比较两个算法</strong>：交织可以告诉你 A 比 B 好还是 B 比 A 好，但无法告诉你具体好多少（效果量化困难）。</p>\n<p><strong>无法测量绝对指标</strong>：交织只有相对比较（谁更好），无法测量&quot;算法 A 使 CTR 提升了2.3%&quot;这类绝对指标，而 A/B 测试可以。</p>\n<p><strong>工程复杂度</strong>：需要在展示层实现交织逻辑，以及在点击归因时正确将点击归属到对应算法，工程实现比标准 A/B 测试复杂。</p>\n<p><strong>工业实践</strong>：大型搜索平台（如 Bing、Google、淘宝）通常<strong>两种方法结合使用</strong>：用交织实验做早期快速筛选（识别有潜力的改进方向，高效过滤），用 A/B 测试做最终的量化评估和上线决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cuped-方差缩减技术\">CUPED：方差缩减技术</h2><p>CUPED（Controlled-experiment Using Pre-Experiment Data，Deng et al., 2013）是微软提出的通过利用实验前数据减少实验方差的统计技术，在不增加流量的情况下提升实验功效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基本原理\">基本原理</h3><p>在 A/B 测试中，实验估计量的方差越小，需要的样本量越少，实验功效越高。CUPED 的核心思想是：用户的<strong>实验前行为</strong>（如过去30天的点击率）是用户实验期间行为的强预测因子，通过从实验指标中减去由实验前行为解释的部分，可以显著降低残差方差。</p>\n<p>设实验指标为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span>（如实验期间的 CTR），用户的实验前协变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>（如实验前30天的 CTR）。CUPED 定义调整后的指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{cuped} = Y - \\hat{\\theta} \\cdot X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\theta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是通过最小二乘法估计的：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Cov</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>Var</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\theta} = \\frac{\\text{Cov}(Y, X)}{\\text{Var}(X)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"方差缩减的数学推导\">方差缩减的数学推导</h3><p>调整后指标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{cuped}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的方差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Var</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Var</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Var</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Var}(Y_{cuped}) = \\text{Var}(Y - \\hat{\\theta} X) = \\text{Var}(Y)(1 - \\rho^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2079em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>Cor</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\text{Cor}(Y, X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cor</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是实验指标与实验前协变量的相关系数。</p>\n<p><strong>方差缩减比</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - \\rho^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。相关性越强，方差缩减越显著：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span></span></span></span></span>：方差缩减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.49</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>51</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - 0.49 = 51\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.49</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">51%</span></span></span></span></span>，功效等价于样本量增加一倍</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span>：方差缩减64%，功效等价于样本量增加2.8倍</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span>：方差缩减81%，功效等价于样本量增加5.3倍</li>\n</ul>\n<p>搜索排序实验中，用户历史 CTR 与实验期间 CTR 通常有较强相关性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\approx 0.6-0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span>），因此 CUPED 能带来显著的功效提升。</p>\n<h3 id=\"cuped-的实现注意事项\">CUPED 的实现注意事项</h3><p><strong>协变量选择</strong>：最佳协变量是与实验指标高度相关的实验前指标，通常就是同一指标在实验前窗口的值（实验前30天 CTR）。也可以使用多个协变量（CUPED 推广到多变量回归），进一步降低方差。</p>\n<p><strong>实验前窗口</strong>：协变量计算窗口应该选在实验期之前且不受实验影响的时间段。通常选实验开始前7-30天。窗口太短（行为样本少，估计噪声大），窗口太长（用户偏好可能已经变化，相关性降低）。</p>\n<p><strong>无偏性验证</strong>：CUPED 调整不改变处理效应的期望值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[Y_{cuped,treatment}] - \\mathbb{E}[Y_{cuped,control}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是无偏估计），可以用模拟实验（A/A test）验证调整后的估计是否无偏。</p>\n<p><strong>与其他方差缩减方法结合</strong>：CUPED 可以与分层抽样（Stratified Sampling）结合，进一步降低方差。例如，先按用户活跃度分层，在每一层内分别做 CUPED 调整，再加权合并。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实验平台工程设计\">实验平台工程设计</h2><h3 id=\"实验平台的核心功能\">实验平台的核心功能</h3><p><strong>分流系统</strong>：将用户按一致的规则分配到实验组和对照组。核心需求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一致性（Consistency）</strong>：同一用户在同一实验中应始终在相同组</li>\n<li><strong>正交性（Orthogonality）</strong>：多个实验同时进行时，各实验的用户分组互相独立（不同实验不互相影响）</li>\n<li><strong>可扩展性</strong>：支持数百个并行实验</li>\n</ul>\n<p>常用的分流方式是基于用户 ID 的哈希函数：<code>hash(user_id + experiment_id) % 100 &lt; traffic_percentage</code> 决定用户是否进入实验。</p>\n<p><strong>指标计算系统</strong>：实验期间持续计算各组的关键指标（CTR、GMV、NDCG 等），并实时展示当前统计显著性和置信区间。</p>\n<p><strong>统计检验系统</strong>：自动对比实验组和对照组的指标差异，计算 p-value 和置信区间，支持：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>双尾 t 检验（检验指标是否显著变化）</li>\n<li>CUPED 方差缩减调整</li>\n<li>多重比较校正（当同时监控多个指标时，需要 Bonferroni 或 Benjamini-Hochberg 校正防止假阳性）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实验生命周期管理</strong>：从实验创建、流量配置、启动、监控、暂停/停止、结论沉淀的全流程管理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实验配置流水线\">实验配置流水线</h3><p>搜索排序实验通常需要以下组件协作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"实验配置（实验 ID、实验组配置、流量分配）&#10;         ↓&#10;分流服务（在线查询分流结果）&#10;         ↓&#10;排序系统（根据实验配置使用对应算法/模型）&#10;         ↓&#10;点击日志采集（带实验 ID 标记）&#10;         ↓&#10;指标计算（按实验 ID 分组统计）&#10;         ↓&#10;统计显著性检验 → 实验结论\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>实验配置（实验 ID、实验组配置、流量分配）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>分流服务（在线查询分流结果）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>排序系统（根据实验配置使用对应算法/模型）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>点击日志采集（带实验 ID 标记）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>指标计算（按实验 ID 分组统计）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>统计显著性检验 → 实验结论</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"快速迭代的实验文化\">快速迭代的实验文化</h3><p>实验平台的价值不只在于技术实现，更在于支撑快速实验的文化和流程：</p>\n<p><strong>实验前提假设</strong>：每次实验前明确写下&quot;为什么这个改进会有效&quot;的假设，帮助团队形成对实验结果的预期，也便于在实验失败时理解失败原因。</p>\n<p><strong>A/A 测试（对照实验的对照实验）</strong>：在正式实验前运行一次 A/A 测试（两组都用相同算法），验证实验平台的分流、指标计算是否正确。如果 A/A 测试显示显著差异，说明实验平台有问题，需要先修复。</p>\n<p><strong>实验期长度的确定</strong>：不要根据&quot;何时达到显著性&quot;来决定停止实验（这会导致 p-value hacking，虚假提高发现率），而应<strong>预先确定</strong>实验期长度（通常7-14天）和所需样本量，在预设时间点进行一次性分析。</p>\n<p>**新奇效应（Novelty Effect）**的处理：一个新的搜索结果布局或排序策略可能因为&quot;新鲜感&quot;而在实验初期表现出虚高的 CTR，随时间回归。对于涉及 UI 变化的实验，需要至少运行2-4周观察新奇效应是否消退，以实验末期（而非平均）的指标作为最终判断依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>搜索排序实验平台是算法快速迭代的基础设施核心。传统 A/B 测试因干扰效应和低功效在搜索场景存在局限，交织实验（Team Draft Interleaving）通过将两个系统的结果在同一请求内交叉排列，消除了用户偏好噪声，将实验灵敏度提升 10-100 倍，适合快速筛选排序算法改进；CUPED 方差缩减利用用户实验前的历史行为作为协变量，可等效减少 20-50% 的所需流量，加速实验周期。实验平台的工程关键是：正确的流量分层保证各实验互相正交、健全的指标体系区分主要指标和护栏指标、以及预先约定实验期长度和分析时间点，避免 p-value hacking 导致的错误决策。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"排序实验平台","id":"排序实验平台"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"搜索实验的特殊挑战","id":"搜索实验的特殊挑战"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么搜索 A/B 测试有偏差","id":"为什么搜索-a-b-测试有偏差"},{"level":3,"text":"搜索实验的低功效问题","id":"搜索实验的低功效问题"},{"level":3,"text":"解决方案概述","id":"解决方案概述"},{"level":2,"text":"交织实验（Interleaving）","id":"交织实验-interleaving"},{"level":3,"text":"基本思想","id":"基本思想"},{"level":3,"text":"Team Draft Interleaving（TDI）算法","id":"team-draft-interleaving-tdi-算法"},{"level":3,"text":"交织实验的优势","id":"交织实验的优势"},{"level":3,"text":"交织实验的局限","id":"交织实验的局限"},{"level":2,"text":"CUPED：方差缩减技术","id":"cuped-方差缩减技术"},{"level":3,"text":"基本原理","id":"基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"方差缩减的数学推导","id":"方差缩减的数学推导"},{"level":3,"text":"CUPED 的实现注意事项","id":"cuped-的实现注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"实验平台工程设计","id":"实验平台工程设计"},{"level":3,"text":"实验平台的核心功能","id":"实验平台的核心功能"},{"level":3,"text":"实验配置流水线","id":"实验配置流水线"},{"level":3,"text":"快速迭代的实验文化","id":"快速迭代的实验文化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实时个性化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-search-ranking/systems/realtime-personalization"},"next":{"title":"搜索质量指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-search-ranking/quality/search-quality-metrics"}}